+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610603_ContentText": "Lisha, apprentice Artisan, reporting for duty!",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610603_SubTitle": "Artisan's Search",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610603_ThumbnailText": "Artisan's Search",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610604_ContentText": "Here Mengzhou's mountains and rivers, its woods and wilds, meet its pavilions and towers, the very place the people of Mengzhou, bound to one another across time, make their homes and live out their lives. Peace and quiet, ardor and flame, despondency and sorrow, every feeling there is settles into a Heart Realm of its own, continuing without end. In this small world, the Court of Savantae and Hsin are shaping the face of Mengzhou anew.\nThis is the Simulacrum Nexus.",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610604_SubTitle": "Dreams in the Capsule",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610604_ThumbnailText": "Dreams in the Capsule",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610605_ContentText": "Hsin has arranged a task for Suoming, asking you to join her in recording the sights of the Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou. A trip \"down memory lane\" that draws out the long-sealed memories of the Ten Seals Covenant...",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610605_SubTitle": "Past Dreams, Traced Seals",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610605_ThumbnailText": "Past Dreams, Traced Seals",
