+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610606_ThumbnailText": "Beyond the Waves: Land of Xuanfang",
+  "AdvertisingActivity_3610607_ContentText": "The Waking Moon Festival begins right on schedule, its lanterns bright as day. Before you stands a mysterious stall... Participate in the fishing challenge and unlock entries in the Fishing Index to win Astrites! And complete event tasks to win Advanced Sealed Tubes and more.",
