   "AdvertisingIntelligence_3510501_ContentText": "Qingxiao - Accessory\nCloudbloom\n\nJingran - Accessory\nSnowpaw\n\n*These Accessories will be removed from the featured content after Version 3.6 and remain available as permanent items purchasable with Astrites. For more details, please stay tuned to the official announcements.",
