   "AdvertisingRegion_2810301_ContentText": "A warm, humid haven beneath the Roya Frostlands. Following an ancient polar shift, this region became the new Solaris pole, prompting the Roya to migrate below ground. Here, the Spacetrek Collective established Startorch Academy. Today, this borderless academic city has become a cradle for countless rising scholars.",
   "AdvertisingRegion_2810301_SubTitle": "Lahai-Roi",
   "AdvertisingRegion_2810301_ThumbnailText": "Lahai-Roi",
@@ -6870,6 +6933,29 @@
   "AdvertisingRegion_3410305_ContentText": "Shaftpost Yard located in the Southern Yuan Hills is the transport hub of the Land of Xuanfang. Resources shipped from the rest of the world gather here before they are dispatched to their destinations on the endless fleets of Jade Steed Haulers and Skybarges.",
   "AdvertisingRegion_3410305_SubTitle": "Southern Yuan Hills",
   "AdvertisingRegion_3410305_ThumbnailText": "Southern Yuan Hills",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610301_ContentText": "Xuanfang Hold's control mainframe, otherwise known as the Manifold Sanctum, governing the foundational order that keeps the city running.",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610301_SubTitle": "Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610301_ThumbnailText": "Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610302_ContentText": "The entrance to the Simulacrum Nexus. Forest paths twist and intertwine, shifting with each heartscape. Without guidance, those who enter may find themselves returning to where they began, without even realizing it…",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610302_SubTitle": "Heartscape Labyrinth",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610302_ThumbnailText": "Heartscape Labyrinth",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610303_ContentText": "A stable inner realm within the Simulacrum Nexus. Mengxuan Vale is home to the Celestials, while the mountains, rivers, and living things of Mengzhou follow the Sanctum's order here, forming a world of their own between dream and reality…",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610303_SubTitle": "Heart of Stillness",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610303_ThumbnailText": "Heart of Stillness",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610304_ContentText": "A realm within the Simulacrum Nexus shaped by memories of the Waking Moon Festival. Passing light turns across jade. Flickering shadows become stars. The Waking Moon's old glory endures in memory, scattered still throughout the streets and lanes…",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610304_SubTitle": "Heart of Flames",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610304_ThumbnailText": "Heart of Flames",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610305_ContentText": "A realm within the Simulacrum Nexus shaped by memories of the old Land of Xuanfang. Snow settles on buried blades. Old cities stir beneath the frost. Obsessions never untangled, doubts never laid to rest—all held in frozen stillness.",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610305_SubTitle": "Heart of Frost",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610305_ThumbnailText": "Heart of Frost",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610306_ContentText": "A realm within the Simulacrum Nexus shaped by memories of unresolved regrets. A broken shuttle, long silent. But the warmth of old ties remains. Unfinished wishes and paths never taken all rest here, beside the Cloud Shuttle.",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610306_SubTitle": "Heart of Ruin",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610306_ThumbnailText": "Heart of Ruin",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610307_ContentText": "A realm within the Simulacrum Nexus shaped by memories of Xuanfang's flourishing flora. Green fills courtyards. Blooms follow footsteps. All is tranquil and at ease, yet echoes of the past seem to linger here as well…",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610307_SubTitle": "Heart of Bloom",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_3610307_ThumbnailText": "Heart of Bloom",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_NewArea_Title": "New Area",
+  "AdvertisingRegion_NewScene_Title": "New Scene",
   "AdvertisingStory_2810201_ContentText": "To reach Lahai-Roi in the midst of a Void Storm, you dive into the spatial tunnel, which pulls you into a strange dimension...\n\nUpon arriving in Lahai-Roi, you chance upon Lynae, a student who leads you to Startorch Academy. As you begin enrollment, everything about this \"academic metropolis\" unfolds before your eyes. Meanwhile, shadows stir beneath the Void Storm...",
   "AdvertisingStory_2810201_SubTitle": "Chapter III Act I \"What Burns Beneath Frostlands\"",
   "AdvertisingStory_2810201_ThumbnailText": "What Burns Beneath Frostlands",
@@ -6920,6 +7006,13 @@
   "AdvertisingStory_3510202_ContentText": "Days after the crisis has been resolved, Liangyu brings you news of the Nethermancer's return. As agreed, you decide to meet him at Xianling Village. The old debts have been buried. Yet new storms gather at the horizon...",
   "AdvertisingStory_3510202_SubTitle": "Chapter IV Segue - The Nethermancer's Requiem",
   "AdvertisingStory_3510202_ThumbnailText": "The Nethermancer's Requiem",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3610201_ContentText": "The Waking Moon Festival is drawing near in the Land of Xuanfang, yet rumors that \"the Hold is doomed to fall\" have begun to spread through the city. To uncover the cause—and to find Hsin, who has not shown Herself for a long time—you enter the Simulacrum Nexus deep within the Sanctum, together with Suoming, an Intendant who claims to have been sent by the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs in search of Hsin the Moon Fox...",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3610201_SubTitle": "Chapter IV Act IV - <word>Simulacrum of the Heart</word>",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3610201_ThumbnailText": "Simulacrum of the Heart",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3610202_ContentText": "A mysterious girl approaches you on WavesLine, asking for your help to collect the scattered Feeling Capsule shards.",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3610202_SubTitle": "Moonlike Heart, Mortal Longing",
+  "AdvertisingStory_3610202_ThumbnailText": "Moonlike Heart, Mortal Longing",
+  "AdvertisingStory_TaleQuest_Title": "New Tales Quest",
   "AdvertisingSystem_2810701_ContentText": "As you explore Lahai-Roi, a new Expedition Motorbike Utility will be available\n\nThe expedition motorbike helps you move faster. Its functionalities improve through upgrades.\n\nWhen on the expedition motorbike, use features such as acceleration, Boost, Drift, and Bounce Jump etc. While moving, a force field is deployed around the expedition motorbike, and the Resonator will be forced to dismount once the force field is down.\n\nThe motorbike is equipped with the Adaptive Hook module, which can be used to grab resources, Sonance Caskets, and other items over long distances.  \n\nThe motorbike is able to receive the Heart Radio Channel, allowing you to tune in and enjoy your favorite music while on the road.\n\nNumerous Challenge Tracks can be found in Lahai-Roi for you to take on with the motorbike.",
   "AdvertisingSystem_2810701_SubTitle": "Expedition Motorbike",
   "AdvertisingSystem_2810701_ThumbnailText": "Expedition Motorbike",
@@ -7008,8 +7101,25 @@
   "AdvertisingSystem_3510704_ContentText": "In Version 3.6, the Echo Recommendation feature in the Echo Equipment screen will be upgraded. Following the update, you may directly preview the effects of an Echo plan and compare them with the current loadout. At the same time, Echo Recommendation now suggests Main Echoes and COST combinations based on the selected loadout plan.",
   "AdvertisingSystem_3510704_SubTitle": "Echo Recommendation Optimization",
   "AdvertisingSystem_3510704_ThumbnailText": "Echo Recommendation Optimization",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610701_ContentText": "In Version 3.7, all unequipped, non-upgraded Echoes in your Echo Backpack that share the same Echo type, Sonata Effect, and Mainstat will automatically stack into a single backpack item. Each backpack item can hold up to 999 Echoes.\n\n*During auto-stacking, your Echoes will be marked according to the following priority: Locked > Discarded > Unmarked.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610701_SubTitle": "Echo Stack Feature",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610701_ThumbnailText": "Echo Stack Feature",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610702_ContentText": "Handheld and Selfie Modes are now available, with several adjustable poses and expressions added to Selfie Mode. Tripod Mode now features a more freely controllable drone perspective. In addition, the Camera System now offers expanded camera tools, including Reference Lines, Quick Focus, and Lens Templates, making it easier to compose shots and fine-tune the image. You can also adjust environmental settings such as Time, Weather, and Foliage Wind Direction in the Environment tab.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610702_SubTitle": "Upgraded Camera System",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610702_ThumbnailText": "Upgraded Camera System",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610703_ContentText": "In Version 3.7, you can replay main quests from Version 1.1 - Thaw of Eons, the Moon-Chasing Festival event from Version 1.2 - In the Turquoise Moonglow, and main quests from Version 1.3 - To the Shore's End in Journey Log.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610703_SubTitle": "Main Quest Replay Mode",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610703_ThumbnailText": "Main Quest Replay Mode",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610704_ContentText": "A new 3D Team Setup Mode is now available, allowing you to switch between 2D and 3D display modes based on your needs.\nThe number of team setups has been increased to 20. Team Management is also now available, allowing you to quickly reorder and name your team setups for easier organization.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610704_SubTitle": "3D Team Setup",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610704_ThumbnailText": "3D Team Setup",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610705_ContentText": "Tiered Client Resource Downloads will be available for the PC, iOS, and Android versions of the game. The PC version supports downloads in three resource tiers: UHD, HD, and SD, while the mobile versions support two: HD and SD. The resource package size and graphics quality vary by tier. You can choose the tier that best suits your device specifications and needs.\n\n*As this optimization involves significant changes to the game client, Tiered Client Resource Downloads will initially be launched as a limited test. As we gradually roll out the test, the dev team will closely monitor your feedback and continue to optimize the feature. Stay tuned for more information on this feature.",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610705_SubTitle": "Tiered Client Resource Downloads",
+  "AdvertisingSystem_3610705_ThumbnailText": "Tiered Client Resource Downloads",
